    {
      "name": "elder_titan_echo_stomp",
      "id": 5589,
      "name_zh": "回音重踏",
      "name_en": "Echo Stomp",
      "description_zh": "持续施法 - 上古巨神与他的灵体游魂一起践踏地面，对敌方单位造成伤害并使他们在原地昏迷。上古巨神造成物理伤害，灵体游魂造成魔法伤害。",
      "description_en": "CHANNELED - Elder Titan and his Astral Spirit both stomp the ground, damaging and knocking nearby enemy units unconscious around their locations.  The Elder Titan stomp deals physical damage, while the Spirit stomp deals magical damage.",
      "notes_zh": [
        "若同时处于灵体游魂和上古巨神的回音重踏作用范围内将受到两次伤害。"
      ],
      "notes_en": [
        "If a unit is hit by Astral Spirit and Elder Titan, they will take both instances of damage."
      ],
