      "name": "elder_titan_ancestral_spirit",
      "id": 1392,
      "name_zh": "灵体游魂",
      "name_en": "Astral Spirit",
      "description_zh": "上古巨神放出他的灵体游魂，灵魂对任何经过的单位都会造成伤害。当它与巨神合体时，它每伤害过一个单位都会给予若干攻击力和移动速度加成。\n\n灵体游魂拥有回音重踏，回归和自然秩序三个技能。",
      "description_en": "Elder Titan sends forth his Astral Spirit, damaging any units it passes through.  When the spirit rejoins the Titan, it grants bonus damage and movement speed for each unit it passed through.\n\nThe Astral Spirit possesses the Echo Stomp, Return Spirit, and Natural Order abilities.",
